# The lent pair's shortcut, where `lend` names what the first chart holds before it sets the second's fields: `fig, ax =
# self.fig, self.ax`, then `other.fig, other.ax = fig, ax`. A projection bound to a name first is still the projection
# (#121, #174): each field of the second is set to the first's field of the same name (`Set::of`), as `other.fig, other.ax
# = self.fig, self.ax` sets it. The plan is the lent pair's: the second chart holds the first's figure, and the screen
# shows one; what differs is who sets the second chart's fields.

route notebooks.overlay
step overlay/overlay
step overlay/overlay/Chart()
step overlay/overlay/Chart()#2
step overlay/overlay/Chart.line
choice overlay/overlay/Chart.line/?1
step overlay/overlay/Chart.line/?1/Chart.create_figure
step overlay/overlay/Chart.lend
step overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2
choice overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2/?1
step overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2/?1/Chart.create_figure

line entry > overlay call
line overlay/overlay/Chart() > Chart·first@overlay/overlay/Chart() value
line overlay/overlay/Chart()#2 > Chart·second@overlay/overlay/Chart()#2 value

line Chart·first@overlay/overlay/Chart() > overlay/overlay/Chart.line/?1/Chart.create_figure value   # `self.create_figure()`
line overlay/overlay/Chart.line/?1/Chart.create_figure > Chart·self@overlay/overlay/Chart.line/?1 value
line overlay/overlay/Chart.line/?1/Chart.create_figure > Figure 1 · Chart · first own              # `plt.subplots()`
line Chart·self@overlay/overlay/Chart.line/?1 > overlay/overlay/Chart.line value                     # `self.ax.plot(..)`
line overlay/overlay/Chart.line > Chart·first@overlay/overlay/Chart.line value

line Chart·first@overlay/overlay/Chart.line > overlay/overlay/Chart.lend value                      # `fig, ax = self.fig, self.ax`
line Chart·second@overlay/overlay/Chart()#2 > overlay/overlay/Chart.lend value                      # `other.fig, other.ax = fig, ax`
line overlay/overlay/Chart.lend > Chart·second@overlay/overlay/Chart.lend value

line Chart·second@overlay/overlay/Chart.lend > overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2/?1/Chart.create_figure value
line overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2/?1/Chart.create_figure > Chart·self@overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2/?1 value
line overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2/?1/Chart.create_figure > Figure 1 · Chart · first own            # the figure lend set it to
line Chart·self@overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2/?1 > overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2 value
line overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2 > Chart·second@overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2 value
line Chart·second@overlay/overlay/Chart.line#2 > overlay/overlay value                               # `return second`
line overlay/overlay > Chart·chart@overlay/overlay value                                             # `chart = overlay(..)`

